:var( --e-global-typography-primary-line-height );letter-spacing:var( --e-global-typography-primary-letter-spacing );}.elementor-2156 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5f02ba20 .elementor-heading-title{font-size:26px;line-height:33px;}.elementor-2156 .elementor-element.elementor-element-5f02ba20 > .elementor-widget-container{margin:0px 0px 10px 0px;}.elementor-widget-text-editor{font-size:var( --e-global-typography-text-font-size );line-height:var( --e-global-typography-text-line-height );}}/* Start custom CSS for text-editor, class: .elementor-element-2cecf0d0 */.elementor-2156 .elementor-element.elementor-element-2cecf0d0 ul {\n    list-style: none;\n}\n.elementor-2156 .elementor-element.elementor-element-2cecf0d0 ul li:before {\n    content: \"•\";\n    position: relative;\n    top: 2px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 1em;\n    margin-left: -1em;\n    color: #ff8b61;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 1.2em;\n}/* End custom CSS */</style>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<section data-id=\"57a8ae82\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"750\" height=\"375\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<section data-id=\"68393c25\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Group talks\n</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Janet Hranicky, MD., PhD: &#8220;The Power Of Your Mind In Getting Well&#8221;, &amp; &#8220;Addressing Cancer As A Metabolic Disease&#8221;, inspired by her program in PsychoNeuroImmunology &amp; Cancer + a comprehensive binder full of her topics for on-going support</li><li>Simonton Cancer Center&#8217;s renowned new patient program overview: &#8220;Getting Well Again&#8221;, addressing the connection of stress, psychological factors, &amp; cancer, in both the development of cancer &amp; in altering the course of disease</li><li>Kahler &#8220;Key To Stress Profile&#8221; &amp; debrief and indicatory overview by advanced certified trainer. </li><li>Senior Psychotherapist, Andy Roman, &amp; Dr. Hranicky: &#8220;Benefit Of Resolving Emotional Blocks That Interfere With Healing Physiology&#8221;</li><li>Senior Psychotherapist, Anthony Chatham: &#8220;EMDR, As An Emotional Tool To Enhance The Ability To Cope More Effectively With Emotional Distress&#8221;</li><li>Virtual: Executive Director of Simonton Cancer Center, Karen Simonton: &#8220;Identifying Unhealthy Beliefs, To Change, For Empowering Emotional Well-Being &amp; Enhanced Immune Functioning.&#8221;</li></ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Presented By Dr. Janet Hranicky</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>M.D., Ph.D. Founder, The American Health Institute, Inc. Medical Director, BioEnergy Fields Foundation</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Dr. Janet Hranicky is a co-director of the Hippocrates Wellness Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program and pioneer in the field of PsychoNeuroImmunology and cancer.</p><p>Protégé of the late Carl Simonton, M.D., Founder &amp; Past Medical Director of the Simonton Cancer Center, Dr. Hranicky trained &amp; worked with this renowned Radiation Oncologist from 1979–2009. He pioneered the field of PsychoNeuroImmunology &amp; cancer, and was the author of the New York Time's best-selling books: \"Getting Well Again\" &amp; \"The Healing Journey\".</p><p>She has applied her clinical experience and research from working with thousands of people with cancer and training healthcare professionals internationally over the last 30 years to a holistic model in behavioral medicine for regenerative healthcare. She incorporates a multi-disciplinary integration in BioEnergy Field Medicine, consciousness, &amp; epigenetics to alter metabolic physiology &amp; cell-signaling pathways.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>The Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program is a way to reignite and add spark back into your life!</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Your Journey to Wellness</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Detox</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"968\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Detox-icon.svg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tIt is true that throughout the course of our lives, we accumulate a toxic load from the foods we eat, to the air we breathe. But everyone is unique, and so will be your detoxing process for week 1.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Grow</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"674\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Grow-icon.svg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tOn your second consecutive week of the Life Transformation Program, the symptoms of detox have subsided and you are striving to fully take advantage of the resources that surround you.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Transform</h4>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img width=\"800\" height=\"936\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Transform-icon.svg\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\tYou are not the same person who first stepped foot into the Institute. You have achieved the 21 days it takes to renounce bad habits, and adopt new healthy practices.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Meet some of the comprehensive cancer wellness team</h3>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"386\" height=\"386\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/comparison-picture-2.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Brian Clement,</h3><p>Ph.D., N.M.D., L.N. Co-Director</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Brian Clement, Ph.D., L.N. has spearheaded the international progressive health movement for more than three-and-a-half decades. He is the Director of Hippocrates Wellness, in West Palm Beach, Florida (U.S.A.), the world's foremost complementary residential health retreat. Over the last half century, he and his team have pioneered clinical research and training in disease prevention with the help of hundreds-of-thousands of participants.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"386\" height=\"386\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/comparison-picture-1.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Anna Maria Gahns-Clement,</h3><p>Ph.D., L.N. Co-Director</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>Anna Maria Gahns-Clement, Ph.D., L.N. Is co-Director of Hippocrates Wellness. For more than 40 years, Dr. Anna Maria Clement has been an international leader in the progressive health movement. Prior to coming to the United States to join Hippocrates, Anna Maria was the Director of Sweden’s Brandal Health Center in Stockholm, an internationally recognized and highly regarded center for health recovery. She was also a member of the Natural Health Care Coalition, a government-supported effort to unify the field of complementary health care in her native Sweden.</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"386\" height=\"386\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/comparison-picture-3.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>O. Carl Simonton,</h3><p>M.D. Founder, Simonton Cancer Center</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>TBD</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure><img width=\"386\" height=\"386\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/comparison-picture-4.png\" alt=\"\" /></figure><h3>Prof. Thomas Rau,</h3><p>M.D. Sonnenberg Biomedical Health Center Switzerland</p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<p>TBD</p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Learn more about our comprehensive cancer wellness program</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\tThe best way to get more information about our Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program is to book a 30-minute consultation with one of our specialist wellness consultants.\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Book a free 30 minute consultation today</h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://meetings-na2.hubspot.com/marketing-1/comprehensive-cancer-program-\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tBook a Consultation\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>", "seoTitle": "Comprehensive Cancer Wellness Program | %%sitename%%", "seoDesc": "Explore a comprehensive cancer wellness program in Florida focused on nutrition, lifestyle education and whole-person support in a restorative retreat setting.", "canonical": null, "ogTitle": null, "ogDesc": null, "image": "/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/ccwp-header-image-opti.jpg", "terms": {}, "elementor": true}